		{
			"id": "nVCbLtVfHMZeOM76l",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 1 (offense -2, protection -9), threat tier minor, appearing 3."
		},
		{
			"id": "n5ezCON-VLCBJ3QKa",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/spider.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nUuwG283zWq3-wwPT",
			"text": "Independent build total: -104 points of racial traits plus 9 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nhjSWesWbQS08lRl1",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Spider (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nsQBSRJ3AuusdzxLC",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nPbyQ1rjuFUe2dSlK",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 0.001 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nrIUeQN7UScnKYAz-",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "niMRgTRiEHmDcAZbh",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "ni3cHwejgFvDbUCjx",
			"text": "About 7 cm across the legs, which is the SM -9 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "nG_1Q2RPpS_t-4NNj",
			"text": "Rated at the floor and that is the honest answer. It is here for coverage and for scene-dressing, not as an opponent."
		},
		{
			"id": "nLjGFNOlqo34-9YZN",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: Peripheral Vision. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
		{
			"id": "n7sYRonbzBcOn25td",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
